@startuml
title Gym pushup-counter: rep state machine (strict detector)

[*] --> Unknown

Unknown --> Up : posture OK, smoothed min angle >= 160
Unknown --> Down : posture OK, smoothed max angle <= 90

Up --> Down : posture OK, smoothed max angle <= 90 (mark down timestamp)
Down --> Up : posture OK, smoothed min angle >= 160\n(count += 1 iff shoulder drop sufficient and timing valid)

Up --> Pause : posture fails
Down --> Pause : posture fails
Unknown --> Pause : posture fails

Pause --> Unknown : posture recovers

Up --> Up : posture OK, 90 < angle < 160
Down --> Down : posture OK, 90 < angle < 160

note right of Pause
  Posture gate rejects the frame.
  Shoulder-drop anchor, timing
  gate, and smoothers all reset
  so the next valid frame starts
  from a clean slate.
end note

note right of Down
  Rep increments on the Down -> Up
  transition only when:
   - shoulder drop >= 25% of torso
     length since the up anchor
   - elapsed time since mark-down
     is inside [0.5s, 10s]
end note

@enduml
